# Wii U homebrew manager

This repository prepares an SD card for **Aroma** on one North American black Deluxe Wii U (WUP-101, disc drive). The operator is on **macOS**.

## Authoritative procedure

- Live source of truth for console-side steps: https://wiiu.hacks.guide/
- Live Aroma packages: https://aroma.foryour.cafe/
- Re-fetch those pages before giving click-by-click console instructions. Cached docs in `docs/` go stale.
- Do not reconstruct Haxchi, Coldboot Haxchi, Indexiine, or random 2016–2018 tutorials.

## What this repo is for

- Downloading official Aroma/EnvironmentLoader/NAND-dumper packages
- FAT32/MBR SD formatting on macOS (`WIIUHB` label, never `wiiu`)
- Merging zip contents onto the SD root and stripping AppleDouble/`.DS_Store` files
- Copying NAND dumps off the SD into `backups/nand/`
- Tracking this console's checklist in `config/console.json`

## What not to do

- Do not write exploits, payloads, or exploit PoCs.
- Do not add piracy tools, title keys, or links to unauthorized game downloads.
- Do not treat vWii / Nintendont as part of the first Aroma pass.
- Do not continue if the black console has no standby LED / will not reach the Wii U Menu.
- Do not format a disk that `wiiu list-disks` marks internal or larger than a plausible SD card.

Prefer `./scripts/wiiu` for operator actions. Read `AGENTS.md` and `docs/console-profile.md` before changing behavior.
